**Key Features Of The Dataset**

Every record registers the following:

Heart rate (ECG: bpm) and ECG Oxygen levels - SpO₂ Body temperature in °C Height in cm and Weight in kg Age and Gender Gene expression biomarkers (IL-6 and Troponin T) ICD-10 codes Ailments - Myocardial Infarction, Dengue etc.

Computed IV flow rate using AWSPD algorithm-based metrics

Patient remarks and their Timestamp Computed vs Ideal flow rate, and percentage accuracy


**Novelty**

The primary focus of this work is the dynamic computation of IV flow rate using the multi-sensor data AWSPD algorithm alongside; networked IoMT sensors data aggregation as Patient specific metrics Consideration of Clinical relevance through ICD-10 mapping alongside correlation of gene expression.

**File Contents**

Full Dataset with 100,000 entries is contained in AWSPDIV1LakhEntries.csv Python script used to generate the dataset is contained in generateawspd_data.py Optional sample analysis notebooks in future updates Algorithm Logic and Mathematical Model


