Smart infusion pump calibration research IoMT-based health profile generation AI-enabled clinical decision-making tools Abnormal event classification of patients in ICUs - automation and remote Flow control in real-time injection modes (Paracetamol, Anesthesia)

Responsive flow injection techniques (dosing)

